{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"菩提行經卷第二","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"聖龍樹菩薩集頌","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"宋西天中印度惹爛馱囉國三藏明教大師天息災奉詔譯","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]菩提心忍辱波羅蜜多品第四","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]奉行諸善業　施戒而先導　供養於如來　百千劫無盡.","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"修行於羼提　瞋罪而不立　觀種種體空　是故一心忍.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"不得貪快樂　守意令平等　心有瞋惱病　無睡恆不足.","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼此有施主　供給於利養　隨彼愛重心　無得生瞋惱.","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"凡諸親近事　不起於憎嫌　於彼無所瞋　乃得其安樂.","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"忍如是等事　若對於寃家　於瞋若能除　世世獲安樂。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]寃若生於心　於愛亦無喜　若餐瞋惱食　無忍善不壞.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼食我大寃　於我無善利　知彼寃不食　是故忍堅牢.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]二本顯示辱忍品第六.","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]科段.丙次明對治不耐修忍度.又三.今丁初正教修.二本此頌意雲.千劫所累積.布施供佛善.但一起瞋念.滅盡無有餘.","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]丁次明修法.又八.今戊初略標舉.","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"凡見寃來去　歡喜而不瞋　於寃若起瞋　善利終滅盡.","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]忍心常若此　令瞋不得起　住忍無時節　瞋寃自不生。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]若人自保愛　不作惡口業　口業若不離　後感寃家苦。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]畏苦[四]不出離　不行衆苦因　是故堅忍心　獲得諸快樂.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼訥陵誐子　邪見求解脫　刀割火燒身　無利由能忍.","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"愚癡無正見　虛受大苦惱　我以菩提心　雲何苦不忍.","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"蚊蚤壁蝨等　常飢渴苦惱　大癢煩苦人　住忍[五]而不見.","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"寒熱幷雨風　病枷鎖捶打　被諸苦惱事　忍不求快樂.","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[六]殺他血流迸　堅牢心勇猛　割身自見血　怕怖而驚倒.","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"智者心清淨　常懼瞋惱侵.","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"與煩惱相持　忍心恆勇猛.","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[七]蛇腹行在地　喻瞋伏於心　殺之謂無勇　殺彼得最勝.","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]二本此頌說忍辱之要.意雲.若其能成道.何故不歡悅.若或不能成不喜又奚益.","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]戊次出忍境.二本此頌意雲.我及我友輩.不願受苦痛.輕蔑辱詈等.怨敵則反是.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]戊三遮止於己有損所生忿怒.","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[四]據二本當作乃.","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[五]據二本當作何.","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[六]二本此頌文意相反.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[七]二本缺此喻.","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如來大悲者　愍苦說輪迴　使識罪根本　住忍而不作.","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]父母何計心　懼子遭淪溺　持心離瞋怒　自遠大苦報.","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"譬如無智人　令罪而得生　修行而無智　瞋生亦復爾.","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"欲住不思議　當須持自心　於此生愛重　令瞋不生起.","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若貪彼塵境　而生種種罪　因彼諸業力　而不得自由.","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"於境若不貪　彼集無因立　和合心無故　是故無有生.","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]不貪而不生　無得而自說　我得如是故　是生不思議.","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼無生不生　是得雲何有　瞻察於彼此　滅盡得無餘.","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"此心恆清淨　喻隨色摩尼　所變悉從因　無因相何有.","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"過去行行時　彼行[三]何所作　隨彼所行因　等因而感果.","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"一切須由因　因善惡由心　說求性寂靜　如是有何過.","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若取和合因　是樂於苦惱　此心不可住　智人應自勸.","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]下明於法决定而修忍.","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]勘二本此下對外道計神我自性者.辨一切物不由我生皆如幻化.故不應瞋.","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]原刻作尚.今依麗刻及二本改.","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故見寃家　想作善知識　因行如是行　當獲得快樂.","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是諸有情　由業不自在　自在若成就　誰肯趣於苦.","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]散亂心緣塵　心被刺不覺　食斷食增瞋　於苦而返愛.","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"自若無福行　返愛纏縛業　如餐毒藥食　墮於生死崖.","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"自住是煩惱　誠由不自護　欲解脫他人　此事何由得.","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"煩惱迷昏濁　而致於自殺　毒盛無有悲　雲何瞋不護.","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"自性旣愚迷　於他行嬈亂　生彼瞋無疑　如火而能燒.","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"有情性愚時　所行諸過失　愚迷故若此　如煙熏虛空.","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人瞋不護　愚迷無智故　喻持杖勸人　而增彼瞋惱.","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我於過去生　苦惱諸有情　是故於今身　被苦惱能忍.","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我身喻於鐵　受彼燒鎚煆　如彼鐵持身　何得有其苦.","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我今看此身　如無情形像　雖被諸苦惱　而瞋無所起.","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]下就耐苦辨忍.","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"愚迷起愛業　不知其苦本　得苦緣自過　雲何生瞋惱.","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻受地獄苦　飛禽劍林等　知自業所生　何處有瞋惱.","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我得如是業　此過知所起　設令入地獄　不由他所作.","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"欲盡我之業　無量無有邊　我業旣如是　長時受地獄.","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我此過如是　彼實我寃家　雲何分別知　愚迷瞋造作.","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人自護持　對寃忍不恚　是心功德生　地獄雲何入.","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"盡我之所行　得因如彼時　不忍瞋不護　破壞於修行。","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]意無相無形　散亂卽破壞　由身護持故　身苦當忍受.","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我於口惡業　衆過而不作　身不被衆苦　雲何心有瞋.","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我於今生中　淨心行利行　於利益旣無　何事於食飲.","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"凡所作爲事　要在於利他　彼無利非愛　定獲罪無疑.","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"不如今殞沒　無貪邪夀命　邪命住雖久　死當墮苦趣.","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]戊四遮止於己輕蔑所生忿怒.","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"譬如在夢中　百年受快樂　如真實得樂　覺已知暫非.","sortOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻彼時無常　夀命之延促　覺此二事已　彼何得快樂.","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"久處於歡娛　自謂得多益　如行人被劫　裸形復空手.","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"福利隨過減　罪根還復生　福盡罪不生　爲獲不瞋利.","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼何爲破壞　一向作不善　如是不思惟　無善不破壞.","sortOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"無得讚於瞋　破壞有情故　如是心利他　彼瞋無由生.","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"爲彼修心人　於忍不住故　見彼煩惱生　是讚忍功德。","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]塔像妙法等　有謗及破壞　佛等無苦惱　我於彼不瞋.","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"於師幷眷屬　不作於愛業　今因過去生　見之而自勉.","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"覺心觀有情　恆在衆苦惱　見彼如是已　於苦惱能忍.","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"瞋恚與愚癡　分別過一等　於此毒過咎　何得說無過.","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"雲何於過去　而作害他業　如是諸業因　閒斷此何作.","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]戊五遮止己友損害善不善處所生忿怒.","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如佛福亦然　我今一心作　與一切有情　慈心互相覩.","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻火燒其舍　舍中而火入　舍中若有草　彼火自延蔓.","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是還喻心　和合於瞋火　燒彼福功德　剎那無所有.","sortOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人殺在手　放之善可稱　地獄苦能免　此善誰不實.","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人在世閒　少苦不能忍　地獄苦無量　瞋因何不斷.","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我以如是苦　歷百千地獄　一一爲利他　所作不自爲.","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我無如是等　諸大苦惱事　以離世閒故　爲利如是行。","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]離苦獲快樂　彼皆讚功德　得彼如是讚　雲何而不喜.","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼旣得如此　無礙之快樂　利他行最上　智者何不勉.","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是最上行　得快樂不修　此見若不捨　破壞於正見.","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若敬愛於他　以德自稱讚　他德旣稱讚　乃是自敬愛.","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"當發菩提心　爲一切有情　令得諸快樂　雲何瞋有情.","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]戊六遮止怨敵稱讚或輕蔑所生忿怒.","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"佛爲三界供　欲有情成佛　世利得不實　彼煩惱何作.","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人之骨肉　乃及諸眷屬　養育與命等　不喜瞋何生.","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如彼求菩提　當用菩提心　而不愛有情　福自捨何瞋.","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人有所求　出財大捨施　所求旣不獲　不如財在舍.","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"清淨功德福　何障而不獲　得已自不受　如住瞋修行.","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"作罪與作福　不同不隨喜　亦復不依作　當自一無得。","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]若愛於寃家　欲求其歡喜　復求諸讚說　此事無因緣.","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"雖欲利圓滿　返苦而無樂　菩提心不忍　於利不成就.","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"煩惱之惡鉤　牽人不自在　猶如地獄卒　擲人入湯火.","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我本求利他　何要虛稱讚　無福無夀命　無力無安樂.","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"自利行不圓　智者應須覺　後後而自行　當愛樂圓滿.","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"修行要稱讚　若持刃自殺　如世不實事　無益無利樂.","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]以下藏本第二卷.科段戊七遮止障所欲境所生忿怒.","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"譬如破壞舍　日照內外見　亦由稱讚非　須用心明了.","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"汝思惟於聲　起滅而平等　心如此利他　當行如是行.","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"於他何所愛　而行於利益　彼旣獲快樂　我利益非虛.","sortOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼彼獲利樂　以一切讚我　雲何而於我　無別威德樂.","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼如是讚我　以愛彼自得　彼無緣若此　如愚如迷者.","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"此讚我雖獲　速破而勿著　憎惡正德者　由此而瞋作.","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是讚成障礙　我令不發起　護不墮惡趣　爲彼行無我.","sortOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若解諸有情　利養尊卑縛　令有情解脫　彼意雲何瞋.","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人欲捨苦　來入解脫門　此是佛威德　雲何我瞋彼。","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]此瞋我不作　於福障礙故　修行平等忍　彼無不獲得.","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"自身諸過失　忍辱故不作　過失不作故　彼福而獲得.","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人福無有　安忍而自生　常令安住忍　雲何說障礙.","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]戊八遮止障礙福德所生忿怒.","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世求利益人　不於施作障　障礙出家故　是不得出家.","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世閒諸難得　求者而能與　我唯說善利　於過無所得.","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"以彼菩提行　遠離於所寃　如出舍中藏　是故雲不難.","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"懺悔於業因　彼初爲先導　是故於忍果　如是而得生.","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼無我所心　此心乃住忍　成就不思議　供養於妙法.","sortOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"此心爲利他　乃至以夀命　或以寃不供　雲何別說忍.","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"於彼彼惡心　各各與忍辱　於如是得忍　因供養妙法.","sortOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"佛土衆生土　大牟尼說此　於彼奉事多　能感於富貴.","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如來及於法　與有情平等　尊重於佛故　尊有情亦然.","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"立意乃如是　於自無所作　以彼大平等　平等於有情.","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"大意於有情　慈心而供養　發心如佛福　如佛福可得.","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故佛法行　佛有情平等　佛無所平等　功德海無邊.","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"佛功德精純無功德能比　雖三界供養見之而不能.","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"佛法等之師是最上有情　供養諸有情當如此作意.","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"於自之眷屬不能起利行　於他之奉事不作得何過.","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"破壞身入無閒獄若彼作已復我作　廣大心爲彼一切如是當行於善事.","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻世人爲自在主由於己事不稱情　雲何而爲彼作子我作非彼奴僕性.","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻佛入苦而無苦如得快樂復歡喜　要歡喜彼一切佛佛喜爲彼能作此.","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如身煩惱而普有欲一切乏悉充足　於有情苦亦復然我無方便空悲慜.","sortOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故此苦我遠離救一切苦興大悲　先嬈惱於忍辱人彼罪我今而懺悔.","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我今奉事於如來同於世閒諸僕從　衆人足蹈我頂上受之歡喜而同佛.","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世閒一切賤能作以悲愍故無有礙　見此一切無比色彼如是尊誰不敬.","sortOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是奉事於如來如是爲自利成就　如是爲除世苦惱如是我今乃出家.","sortOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"譬如一王人能調伏大衆　衆非一能調以長親王故.","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼一而非獨　蓋有王之力　製斷不怯劣　亦無有過失.","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"悲愍心住忍　力若地獄卒　將護於有情　如事以惡王.","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"瞋非王所令　如彼地獄苦　煩惱於有情　彼苦而自受.","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喜非王所與　如得於佛等　善心於有情　此心何不受.","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]將護於有情　後當得成佛　見感尊重稱　此喜何不見.","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"無病復端嚴　快樂而長命　富貴作輪王　斯皆從忍得。","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]菩提心精進波羅蜜多品第五","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]智者行忍辱　菩提住精進　懈怠遠離福　如離於風行。","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[四]精進力何解　彼要分別說　懈怠不精進　如毒宜自觀。","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[五]貪味於睡眠　謂快樂無事　輪迴苦可嫌　而從懈怠生.","sortOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"煩惱之舍宅　懈怠力牽入　已到無常門　雲何今不知.","sortOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"精進爲自他　此行汝不見　懈怠復睡眠　此如屠肆牛.","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]丁三明修果.","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]二本顯示精進品第七.","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]科段.丙三明對治懈怠修精進.又二.今丁初明次第生起之要.二本此頌意雲.依忍行精進.是菩提依處.如無風不動.無勤福不生.","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[四]丁次正明修相又五.今戊初略標.","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[五]戊二別釋嬾惰卑劣輕疲等懈怠.","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若此而不見　一切道皆斷　彼旣無所得　雲何樂睡眠.","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若得於威儀　無常而忽至　施爲不可及　何以住懈怠.","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"精進而不修　安然若精進　忽然趣無常　思惟而苦苦.","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"見彼燄魔門　苦惱復情急　剎那而淚下　眷屬不能救.","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"聽聞地獄聲　自念業熱惱　身住不淨處　驚怖不能極.","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"地獄苦極惡　惡業何復作　如魚鼎中活　彼得如是怖.","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"地獄業作已　乃受湯火苦　身糜爛苦惱　如何得清淨.","sortOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"魔王多苦人　捉人送無常　無常苦可畏　此見懈怠果.","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"愚迷著睡眠　此過而不劣　入於大苦河　復不得人身.","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"除樂最上法　無邊樂種子　懈怠幷戲笑　苦因汝何樂.","sortOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"見負瞋力多　知彼自精進　自他各所行　如自他平等.","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我何得菩提　而無分別作　以如來真實　實言正解脫.","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼蚊蚋蝱蠅　及蟲蝦蜆等　若獲精進力　亦當得菩提.","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼我何生人　能知利不利　恆知諸精進　何不得菩提.","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"或捨於手足　於此而生怖　愚迷違師教　此利彼不知.","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"斷壞及燒煑　無邊皆拔出　無數俱胝劫　而未得菩提.","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"歷此無數苦　久久證菩提　喻若毒苦傷　毒盡苦皆出.","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"作一切醫人　救療諸病苦　是故苦消除　一切病皆少.","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故說救療　甜藥不利病　上醫療大病　甜藥皆不與.","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"前後皆如是　智者鹹所行　後後而進修　身肉而捨用.","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"智者觀身肉　喻菜而生有　枯[一]謝棄糞土　是捨不名難.","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若身所作苦　心謂其虛作　智者心非惡　彼無惡業苦.","sortOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"知法意快樂　具福身快樂　無此虛輪迴　得苦雲何悲.","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"求盡過去罪　深利他福海　此力菩提心　[二]二乘等要急.","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]原刻作榭.今依麗刻改.","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]二本此句雲.較聲聞爲勝.","sortOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是利不樂　行行何得苦　菩提心輦輿　智者乘得樂.","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]爲成就有情　樂施方便力　身力苦怖作　觀之唯稱讚.","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"斷如是分別　增長於精進　[二]我身而能捨　超過身方便。","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]我消除自他　無數之過失　一一之過失　若劫盡無餘.","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼過一一盡　我無有纖毫　無邊苦已脫　我心雲何損.","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我求多功德　爲利於自他　學一一功德　劫盡學無盡.","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"纖毫之功德　我生不曾作　或當得生處　虛度無所有.","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我樂興大供　供養佛世尊　爲[四]貧不能作　而願不圓滿.","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"不施怖者安　不修母快樂　如入母胎藏　母唯病苦惱.","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"過去爲離法　我今得果報　所生旣如是　當行何法行.","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"一切善心根　世間之牟尼　彼根恆不退　常得好果報.","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"煩惱苦纏綿　而得種種怖　於他愛障難　生罪而自感.","sortOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]戊三總釋能治法中四兵.二本此頌意雲.成就利生故.有四種法兵.勝解及自慢.歡喜及能捨.","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]二本此半頌意雲.因勝解等四.自在而精進.","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[三]戊四別解法中四兵.初釋勝解.","sortOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[四]原刻作貪.今依麗刻改.","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人於處處　能起於善願　而感彼彼福　獲得供養果.","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"若人於處處　作罪取快樂　而感彼彼報　獲得苦器侵.","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"月藏中清涼　廣博妙香潔　佛音味第一　非修而不得","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"而彼善逝子　得解善逝法　如蓮出最上　亦如仁覺月.","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"燄魔之獄卒　牽引於罪魂　火坑及洋銅　燒煑悉皆入","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"焰熾殺器仗　斷肉百千斤　墮落熱鐵地　斯由多不善.","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故心作善　極微細觀察.　[一]依彼金剛幡　修學而作觀.","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"初學觀和合　不觀汝非學　而無最上名　汝要迴心作.","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"生中之所作　增長於罪苦　上事業不修　彼下不求勝.","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"三種事應知　由業煩惱力　將來之惡因　於此雲何作.","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世間之煩惱　拘人不自由　我如人不能　是故我無作.","sortOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"下業之所修　雲何令安住　當觀我無我　而此我所作.","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]下釋自慢.二本此半頌意雲.修金剛王幢.以思惟自慢.","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"一滴之甘露　鳥食變金翅　我意謂微劣　能脫少苦難.","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"瞋作無心難　以不善罪故　無心見發起　廣大勝難及.","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故清淨心　頌作此文句　使知彼三界　我遠離戲論.","sortOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我得勝一切　無人能勝我　我今而自知　是佛師子子.","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"有情離我人　而彼得最上　不降懈怠寃　懈怠寃自降.","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"以惡趣所牽　身善速破壞　由僕從愚惡　寄食而受瘦.","sortOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼受於一切　修行住我慢　而此得名聲　下劣雲何說.","sortOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"如是若勇猛　自勝彼寃家　勇猛行此修　慢寃而不勝","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"彼慢心若起　此實我寃家　勝果雖欲生　是果悉皆捨.","sortOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"喻精進師子　煩惱獸中見　煩惱獸千萬　雖衆不能敵.","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世有大苦惱　人自悉具見　煩惱不降伏　乃得如是苦.","sortOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"我寧使頭落　及刳剔心腸　煩惱諸寃家　一切我不[一]降.","sortOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]藏本次有半頌雲.如是於諸境.一秉於正理.乃釋第三歡喜之辭.","sortOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"因修此精進　得彼慢業盡　獲得勝果報　自感嬉戲樂.","sortOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"爲快樂修因　彼却不獲得　所修不決定　亦得不殊勝.","sortOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"輪迴欲不足　喻貪刀刃蜜　福甘露若貪　食之後轉美.","sortOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"是故業寂靜　感妙果隨行　如日溫月寒　晝夜而相逐.","sortOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"精進之有力　能破於懈怠　[一]獲得遠離故　深心而愛樂.","sortOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"煩惱棒堅牢　鬬彼念慧劍　喻棒劍相持　同彼女人學。","sortOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]執劍手無力　失之而怖急　念劍失亦然　地獄而在心.","sortOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"世間知善人　不肯飲毒血　心過亦復然　心過而不作.","sortOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"出家精進心　喻執持油鉢　鉢墜必當死　墜之故驚怖.","sortOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"著睡眠懈怠　喻毒蛇在懷　不去當被傷　去之宜須急.","sortOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_278","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"一一之深過　要迴心思惟　此過不可守　雲何我復作.","sortOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"和合之業因　斷以正念劍　雲何名自位　此念而獲得.","sortOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]二本此半頌意雲.愛樂後事故棄捨於前事.此釋能捨.","sortOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[二]戊五明顧念增上總結上義.","sortOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"正念心不發　纖毫不能滅　來業如往行　一切報皆得.","sortOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]如彼覩羅綿　隨風而來往　精進人亦然　增上如是得。","sortOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"菩提行經卷第二","sortOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_336_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_336","text":"[一]二本此頌意雲.如風往來.綿乃成熟.精進自在.善行方成.","sortOrder":288}],"overrides":{}}